<title>CHILE: Chile's Colbun 1996 net slides.</title>
<headline>Chile's Colbun 1996 net slides.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Power utility Colbun Machicura SA reported the following results last year.</p>
<p>			    1996		 1995</p>
<p>Net profit		   4.42	profit 22.30</p>
<p>Operating profit	   7.44	profit 25.46</p>
<p>Non-operating loss	 2.29	profit  0.93</p>
<p>Total sales		 48.60		 56.13</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of pesos.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595 x212))</p>
